# Wave I.0 — Architecture guard matrix

## Problem

Hostile audit (Verdict C) requires a **trustworthy control plane** before install-graph / thin-shell work:

1. `guard:no-app-cloud-imports` was green after H.k but **not** on any named matrix / defensive path.
2. Guest-runtime `package.json` is manifest-synced (`guard:guest-runtime-product-deps`), but **`apps/web` and `apps/api` workspace product deps remain hand lists** (audit dual-SoT #7) with no orphan check.

Cosmetic Wave H renames do not move thin-shell / bundle / runtime-plugin outcomes. I.0 locks the guard rails.

## Decision

### Matrix — `pnpm run wave-i0:guard`

Runs (fail-fast):

| Guard | Role |
| ----- | ---- |
| `guard:no-app-cloud-imports` | Namespace closure (`@app-tour/` forbidden) |
| `guard:import-boundary` | AST import boundary |
| `guard:workspace-peer-import` | Workspace peer isolation |
| `guard:workspace-registry-fresh` | Codegen ↔ manifests |
| `guard:api-workspace-isolation` | API host isolation ratchet |
| `guard:api-host-allowlist-ratchet` | Gap Closure A — API host allowlist size ≤ budget; no new entries |
| `guard:guest-runtime-product-deps` | Guest-runtime package.json ↔ manifests + product dep ceiling |
| `guard:plugin-host-neutrality` | plugin-host deps ⊆ workspace-sdk |
| `guard:transpile-product-ceiling` | Gap Closure C.2a — guest/admin transpile product package counts ≤ ceiling |
| `guard:deploy-profile-plan` | Gap Closure D.1 — transpile ∩ IgnorePlugin deploy-profile coherence |
| `test:gap-closure-acceptance` | Gap Closure D.2–D.4 / E.1–E.4a — deploy-profile + staging ALLOW + acme create→generate→contract |
| `guard:host-workspace-deps` | web/api `@app-tour/workspace-*` orphans |
| `guard:thin-shell` | **Wave I.3** + Gap Closure A — no non-generated product imports; generated static ≤ budget |
| `guard:shell-product-tokens` | Gap Closure A — branded product-token hit lines in non-generated shell ≤ budget |

Script: [`scripts/wave-i0-guard.sh`](../../scripts/wave-i0-guard.sh).

Gap Closure charter + budgets: [`saas-platform-remediation.mdoc`](./saas-platform-remediation.mdoc).

### `guard:host-workspace-deps` (check-only)

For [`apps/web/package.json`](../../apps/web/package.json) and [`apps/api/package.json`](../../apps/api/package.json):

- Collect every `@app-tour/workspace-*` except `@app-tour/workspace-sdk` from `dependencies` / `devDependencies` / `optionalDependencies`.
- Expected set = every manifest `package` string from `discoverManifests()`.
- **Fail** if any declared host dep is **not** in the expected set (orphan).
- **Wave I.7 / I.8 (web only):** product workspace deps are codegen-synced into `devDependencies` from `productWorkspaceManifests` (`verifyAdminWebPackageJson`); must not appear in `dependencies`.
- Orphan check remains for web + api (declared ∉ any manifest).

### Namespace status

H.k closed `@app-tour/` in admin transpile codegen. I.0 **wires** that guard into the matrix so regressions cannot silently return.

## Out of scope

- `optionalDependencies` / removing IgnorePlugin → first peel [`wave-i-7-host-install-classification.mdoc`](./wave-i-7-host-install-classification.mdoc) (Wave I.7); true filtered installs still later
- Thin-shell owner-settings lazy loader → [`wave-i-1-owner-settings-lazy-loader.mdoc`](./wave-i-1-owner-settings-lazy-loader.mdoc) (Wave I.1)
- `guard:thin-shell` → [`wave-i-3-thin-shell-guard.mdoc`](./wave-i-3-thin-shell-guard.mdoc) (Wave I.3)
- Deleting `apps/web/src/wizard/denali/*`
- Adding `wave-i0:guard` to Husky `pre-commit:fast` (too heavy; run on architecture PRs / explicitly)

## Verify

```bash
pnpm run wave-i0:guard
# expect PASS
```
